    "why": "Every activity here has estimated.hours = true, which is what the Guide agent always produces (src/agents/research.ts tells it to always set estimated.hours = true). So no opening or closing time in this itinerary is a sourced fact, and prose asserting '09:00' or 'opens at 10' launders a guess into something that reads as verified — the exact failure CLAUDE.md rule 9 exists to prevent, and it drops the '~' provenance marker DayTimeline.tsx carefully renders. The prose_excludes list is a fabrication trap: five real Meghalaya attractions that are NOT in this itinerary, which a model padding a thin two-stop day would plausibly reach for. Transport hubs (Shillong, Guwahati) are deliberately NOT in that list, since naming an airport in a practical tip is legitimate advice rather than an invented activity."
